#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:1 7e610c22f13742eaafe31ae4ca288f35
msgid "Basic SQL"
msgstr "SQL基本操作"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:3 8a9e9cf249e64ad98e283357966f2fbe
msgid ""
"After DingoDB is installed and deployed successfully, because DingoDB is "
"compatible with MySQL semantics, you can connect to DingoDB and execute SQL "
"statements through SQL tools or MySQL client."
msgstr ""
"安装并部署成功后，由于 DingoDB 与 MySQL 语义兼容，因此可以通过 SQL 工具或 "
"MySQL 客户端连接 DingoDB 并执行 SQL 语句。"

