msgstr "自动递增字段"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md af8ef10460ca4d4eb9c61d74de34a2c9
msgid ""
"Specifies that a field is a self-incrementing column, currently only the "
"`int` type is supported, and you can set the initial self-increment value."
msgstr "指定字段为自递增列，目前只支持 `int` 类型，可以设置初始自增值。"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md b84208ceec324cb8b828f8125d4bb05a
