msgstr "自动增加"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md 870cfde1b81e462a8bccf718c1a474cd
msgid "Partition By"
msgstr "分区"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md f017f869ba404c33874356ea07f6d8ac
msgid "Range Partition: partition by range;"
msgstr "Range 分区：按Range 分区；"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md aac200c88a9848a2b508a126108ff78e
msgid ""
"Partition the data into different partitions based on the specified range. "
"You can partition by range values for one or more columns."
msgstr ""
"根据指定的范围将数据划分为不同的range。您可以根据一个或多个列的范围值进行分"
"区。"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md 7ce8408492d74060933fe989bec11492
msgid "Hash partition: partition by Key's hash value;"
msgstr "哈希分区：按密钥的哈希值分区；"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md f74d166bd11d4e209c184b9906db456e
msgid ""
"Partition by hash value of a column or multiple columns, each hash value "
"determines the partition to which the data belongs."
msgstr "按列或多列的哈希值进行分区，每个哈希值决定数据所属的分区。"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md a9b483ed00fb461fad2e98b554551dbf
msgid "Engine"
msgstr "引擎"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md 04f7718fe293401d87c59cd3d21a6962
msgid "Storage Engine"
msgstr "存储引擎"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md 5bc3f44d6763479488a0b5a64552624d
msgid ""
"The storage engine specified when creating the table; Dingo provides LSM, "
"BTree, Txn_LSM, Txn_BTree storage engines. The default is: Txn_LSM"
msgstr ""
"创建表格时指定的存储引擎；Dingo 提供 LSM、BTree、Txn_LSM、Txn_BTree 存储引"
"擎。默认值为 Txn_LSM"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md 31e80caa493348098db495639c02cc5a
msgid "Engine = Txn_LSM;"
msgstr ""

