msgid "SQL Example"
msgstr "SQL 示例"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:21
#: a71bc399bbcb4c2590d16c76cd970451
msgid "Create a table with a scalar index"
msgstr "创建带有标量索引的表"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:38
#: 2001e34c8572451992b0663f1f2d9a3d
msgid "Create table with vector indexes"
msgstr "创建带向量索引的表"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:52
#: cda38b4e2f4145d49ecdcb823dba52cd
msgid "*Description:*"
msgstr "*说明:*"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:54
#: 2a4fa890c06343919593a48f3664324b
msgid ""
"Create statement in the feature column vector column, type for the floating-"
"point array, vector columns need to be added after the vector index, if you "
"do not add the vector index will be treated as an ordinary array type, "
"vector index in the definition of the scalar index is similar to that of the "
"corresponding definition of the method to use VECTOR, the need for the "
"parameters have two a vector id column, currently only supports integer, the "
"second parameter is the vector column, the second parameter is the vector "
"column, the vector column. Currently only floating point arrays are "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"创建语句中的特征列为向量列，类型为浮点数组，向量列后需要添加向量索引，如果不"
"添加向量索引将被视为普通数组类型，向量索引中标量索引的定义类似于使用 VECTOR "
"方法的相应定义，需要的参数有两个，一个是向量 id 列，目前只支持整数．目前只支"
"持浮点数组。"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:56
#: efe2f752a87f444e9997b7590484579a
msgid "2. Insert Data"
msgstr "2.插入数据"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:57
#: abf132becd64461985cec6325fb390be
msgid ""
"Take 'vectable' as an example, because the vector field dimension is "
"specified as 8, so the array array needs to contain 8 elements when "
"inserting."
msgstr ""
"以 “vectable ”为例，由于向量字段的维数指定为 8，因此插入时数组需要包含 8 个元"
"素。"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:66
#: 37c57120913547f497f9b6282db826ac
msgid "3. Query Data"
msgstr "3.查询数据"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:67
#: bd62a56bb3bd4b048cb14716e61a413f
msgid "Full table query"
msgstr "全表查询"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:71
#: 077aa52f3d004ca88f800b9ef658a563
msgid ""
"Conditional query, use `WHERE` conditional statement to filter the data "
"conditionally."
msgstr "条件查询，使用 `WHERE` 条件语句有条件地过滤数据。"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:75
#: badee313303d49eb9d1e2c3c42a51ea8
msgid "4. Modify Data"
msgstr "4.修改数据"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:76
#: 17d9631e138740f19d025fc9b47f1532
msgid "Use `UPDATE TABLE` statement to modify the data in the table"
msgstr "使用 “UPDATE TABLE ”语句修改表中的数据"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:80
#: 7ee95ff28c0f4da8a7a225b07662af40
msgid "5. Drop Table"
msgstr "5.删除表"

#: ../../source/deployment/sql_operations.md:81
#: abc77d05ddc64ef68e1f7cfb51dfc6f6
msgid "Use the `DROP TABLE` statement to delete a table."
msgstr "使用 `DROP TABLE` 语句删除表。"
